{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Important:</strong><br>The current version of the game will be replaced by a <strong>Remake</strong> that is currently in development. At the moment, the game only contains a Prologue, which will be discontinued and has a duration of approximately 30\u201340 minutes. The price of the game will change when <strong><i>The</i></strong><i> <strong>Backrooms</strong> <strong>Regret:</strong> <strong>Reborn</strong></i> is released.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u20ac5.99</strong> upon the release of the remake </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/ecdc132fb3b510f09c18506653cbca98.avif?t=1770972565\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras_big/ecdc132fb3b510f09c18506653cbca98.avif?t=1770972565 width=800 height=164 /></span>You are <strong>David Campbell</strong>. You remember nothing. All you know is that you\u2019re trapped in an endless maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for answers, a specialized organization in the Backrooms will offer help\u2026 sometimes. But this place doesn\u2019t forgive the unprepared. If you want to survive, you\u2019ll have to adapt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/15a231605da0d26a98b1aa3e69d56bfe.avif?t=1770972565\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras_big/15a231605da0d26a98b1aa3e69d56bfe.avif?t=1770972565 width=800 height=164 /></span>A A first-person horror game that combines puzzles, intense chases, and an oppressive atmosphere. Every step could be your last, and every decision will determine whether you escape or remain trapped forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras/19941f0e51e783747a257c691dd788a9.avif?t=1770972565\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718450/extras_big/19941f0e51e783747a257c691dd788a9.avif?t=1770972565 width=800 height=164 /></span>We\u2019ve crafted a unique atmosphere to fully immerse you in the Backrooms. The tension never truly fades: there are moments of calm, but the feeling of being watched never disappears.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The nightmare begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/9281ddc7d24e544e6ae2755501d3e441b03f4db8.jpg"},{"name":"Too easy to be true","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/8fac0f2049e356ef8483110ae47b8edce745f1bd.jpg"},{"name":"Nice try","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/87d71a44efe99cff6cfbd2d23d17dab711a1a05e.jpg"},{"name":"Master of wit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/4f826b681348e409f022c4fe0e84fde72cedf058.jpg"},{"name":"This has only just begun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/5a8b91105e8928232fd7af226b3a073d81fd7eed.jpg"},{"name":"The hidden messages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/ed4cfe10a525dd1fb028687938feb3a8ee5814dc.jpg"},{"name":"Thoroughly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/a9765b12935f3455c95b43ea30742ba25a0e83ab.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2718450/9ce68359b605c7d9fb8d862936604ab35c3c27b5.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing stops